{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115859","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115859/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115859/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115859/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115859","id":3894400067,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7BWxla","number":115859,"title":"Fix crash when passing `null` return pointer to GDExtension call methods","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":580537003,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1ODA1MzcwMDM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdextension","name":"topic:gdextension","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-02-04T03:44:05Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T08:32:32Z","closed_at":"2026-03-27T08:07:33Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115859","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115859.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115859.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Added null checking for the return argument in the following methods:\r\n\r\n- `gdextension_variant_call`\r\n- `gdextension_variant_call_static`\r\n- `gdextension_object_call_script_method`\r\n- `gdextension_object_method_bind_call`\r\n\r\nWhen the return pointer is `null`, these functions now ignore it. This allows callers to discard return values when calling void-returning methods or when the return value is not needed.\r\n\r\nMy main motivation for this change is that in the C# bindings we pass a `null` pointer when calling void-returning methods, I don't really care about discarding the return for non-void-returning methods.\r\n\r\nThe documentation for these methods in `gdextension_interface.json` was also updated to explicitly mention what happens if NULL is used as the return argument.\r\n\r\n- I used all uppercase \"NULL\" because it seems to be what we used elsewhere, but I also saw some instances of lowercase \"null\".\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIt was also suggested making the changes to `object_method_bind_ptrcall` for consistency, but I found it to be a different case:\r\n\r\n- All other methods use `GDExtensionUninitializedVariantPtr` for the return argument, whereas this function uses `GDExtensionTypePtr`.\r\n- The `ptrcall` implementation for void-returning methods already ignores null return arguments, which is my main motivation for this change.\r\n- Non-void-returning methods still require a non-null return argument, but I think that's fine.\r\n    \r\n---\r\n\r\n### Alternatives\r\n\r\n- Close this PR as \"working as intended\" and make GDExtension language authors handle it by always passing a non-null pointer for the return argument even for void-returning methods.","closed_by":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115859/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115859/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}